{"title":"广东省项目管理协会组织学习习近平总书记重要讲话和全国两会精神","date":"2024-04-08","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">广东省项目管理协会组织学习习近平总书记</span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 10.5pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:\r\n宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">重要讲话和全国两会精神</span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:22.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:38.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">3</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">月<span lang=\"EN-US\">19</span>日，广东省项目管理协会联合协会常务副会长单位永道工程咨询有限公司组织召开了<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年全国两会会议精神专题学习会，深入学习贯彻习近平总书记的重要讲话精神和全国两会精神。协会会长赖铭华同志，常务副会长、永道工程咨询有限公司总经理周舜英同志和协会秘书处全体员工，永道工程咨询有限公司有关代表同志参加会议。</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:38.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202404/1.png\" style=\"width: 682px; height: 447px;\" /></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(160, 160, 160); letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">赖铭华会长（左）与周舜英常务副会长（右）</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38pt; line-height: 115%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38pt; line-height: 115%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:1.5pt\">会上，大家共同学习了习近平总书记在全国两会期间的重要讲话精神、<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 2024</span>年《政府工作报告》、<span lang=\"EN-US\">2024</span>年国民经济和社会发展计划和发展关键词等重要内容。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:1.5pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38pt; line-height: 115%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:华文中宋;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;letter-spacing:1.5pt\">赖会长指出，今年的全国两会是在新中国成立<span lang=\"EN-US\">75</span>周年、实现&ldquo;十四五&rdquo;规划目标任务的关键之年召开的一次十分重要的会议，习近平总书记在会议期间就因地制宜发展新质生产力、全面深化改革开放、促进区域协调发展、加强生态环境保护、形成推动发展强大合力等发表了一系列重要讲话，学习、宣传、贯彻习近平总书记重要讲话和两会精神是当前协会的一项重要政治任务，协会要立足新时代新征程的使命职责，发挥自身的专长和优势，在创新驱动，特别是在发展新质生产力等方面发力，不断推动协会工作高质量发展。赖会长要求，协会全体工作人员要把学习宣传贯彻全国两会精神特别是习近平总书记重要讲话精神作为当前和今后一个时期的重要政治任务，要结合实际工作，深入学习领悟，切实统一思想，提高认识，用以引领工作方向和目标任务，切实把学习成果转化为推动行业高质量发展的强大动力。</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 38pt; line-height: 115%; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋;\r\nletter-spacing:1.5pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202404/2_%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC.jpg\" style=\"width: 684px; height: 456px;\" />&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 38pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 14pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(160, 160, 160); letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">参会人员交流讨论</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent: 38pt; text-align: center;\">\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:38.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">学习期间，全体参会人员结合业务工作和个人实际，围绕两会的核心展开了全方位、多角度的讨论，对新质生产力、转型升级、创新发展、高质量发展、行业挑战和机遇等内容进行了深入的交流探讨。与会人员纷纷表示，本次会议学习内容与实际工作密切相关，为个人的成长进步与今后的工作创新提供了强大的思想动力，会后将进一步认真学习贯彻习近平总书记的重要讲话和全国两会精神，切实把学习成效转化为工作实效。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>"}